comment author Shinryuu
comment v5.3: v5.2 with an alien fight 2 frames faster: the alien pause is 1 frame shorter (pause-menu up+down cursor trick), which flips the hit parity, and Mega Man ends his knockback stun at X 37.06 on the secret ledge so the Bubble Lead burst can start 1 alien step earlier. v5.2: v5.1 with one lag frame removed before Wily 4 (Mega Man hops into Metal Man's boss door). v5.1: combined movie. Shinryuu's unpublished, faster run (reconstructed from his video) from the start to Wily 4, combined with our improvements (v3 Guts Tank fight, v4.1 Wily 4, v4.2 Wily 5/6) and two Wily 5 refight levers: the Air Man refight is 11 frames faster (Leaf Shield deployed right after the first hit and thrown while Mega Man rises, between the tornado rows), so the Wood Man fill ends 12 frames earlier; the Metal Man refight is 2 frames faster and the Flash capsule is reached 1 frame sooner, so the Flash Man fill ends 4 frames earlier. Refight RNG re-synced through capsule subpixels; Wily 6 platform seeds set with Metal Blade knobs. 242 frames faster than publication 4410.
